    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "pvd sounds scary lol... i didnt know that could happen during pregnancy. and the swelling is really annoying, i can barely get my rings off. you think i should just wait it out for a few days and see if it goes down with some extra water? i'm really tired of going to the doctor for every little thing.",
